# Skills environment variables
# Copy relevant lines to your shell profile (~/.zshrc / ~/.bashrc) or source this file.
# See README.md § "Environment Variables" for full documentation.

# ── Change Management ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Persistent directory for patch files created by /change-management-7-diff and
# read by /change-management-8-apply.
#
# Precedence (highest first):
#   1. Per-invocation parameter (output_path / patch_dir)
#   2. This env var (durable, set once for all invocations)
#   3. Current working directory (fallback)
#
# Recommended: a stable path outside any repo so patches survive branch switches.
#
# CHANGE_MANAGEMENT_REPO_PATH=~/patches
